            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "christine k"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Loved it! I did tweak a bit, some ground pepper and a few drops of lemon juice. I might use less Dijon mustard next time. Still it was delicious!",
            "datePublished": "2024-11-10T00:05:38.858Z"
